Four Balanced Scorecard Perpectives 

## Balanced Scorecard – Four Perspectives

| Perspective        | Focus Area                          | Example Goals                          |
|--------------------|--------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|
| Financial          | Profitability, ROI, cost efficiency | Increase revenue, reduce operating costs |
| Customer           | Satisfaction, retention, market share| Improve customer experience, grow loyalty|
| Internal Processes | Efficiency, quality, innovation      | Streamline workflows, enhance product quality |
| Learning & Growth  | People, skills, culture              | Upskill workforce, foster innovation culture |

*Balanced Scorecard links financial outcomes with customer value, internal efficiency, and organizational learning.*


